# Source photos that show identifiable minors. This repo is PUBLIC: anything
# committed here is downloadable by anyone from raw.githubusercontent.com, at
# every historical path, and a later deletion does not take it back. No
# parental consent is on file (Ley N.° 29733), so these stay out of git
# entirely rather than merely out of the build.
# See assets-source/README.md.
assets-source/restricted/

# Drop zone for new client photos: ignored by default so nothing unreviewed can
# be committed by accident. Sorted into assets-source/<category>/ after review.
assets-source/inbox/*
!assets-source/inbox/README.md
